  "description": "If you like it flamed, modified, chopped or pinstriped, the Railer is the cruiser for you. This is the big-bopper of bikes, moto-inspired and extra-fat. You'll be bumpin' down the boardwalk on extra-wide 3\" tires and a high quality 6061 aluminum SuperCruise frame, tricked out in one of five sick, slick paint jobs. Rounding out your high quality component package: moto-inspired handlebars, coordinating shorty fenders, mechanical disc brakes and seven speed twist shifters.\nLightweight alloy SuperCruise Plus frame with Step-Thru option\nMoto-inspired Railer handlebar for the ultimate statement\nMechanical disc brakes front and rear\nShimano Tourney 7-speed drivetrain with Revo twist shifter\n3-piece alloy crankset\nRailer Plus 26\" x 3\" tires on super-wide 50mm alloy rims\nRear moto-style shorty rear fender keeps you clean",
